== 4b. SummEval paper (arXiv 2007.12626): how the expert scores were produced
PASS  SummEval paper: the paper reports two rounds of expert annotation
PASS  SummEval paper: second-round experts re-checked scores that differed by more than 2 points from another annotator
PASS  SummEval paper: re-evaluating experts were allowed to see the other experts' first-round scores
PASS  SummEval paper: Krippendorff alpha is 0.4132 for the first expert round and 0.7127 after the second
FACT  consequence: SummEval expert ratings are not independent draws: the second round let experts see each other's scores, which pulls them together

